WEBVTT

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.760
The breeze sure is refreshing!

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.940
It seems today will be another good day.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.340
I hope.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.520
I'm really anxious.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.080
Drawing art for a game-making club...

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.530
Tamaki-chan!

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.000
F-F-Fujikawa-senpai?!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.880
Sorry. I didn't think you'd be so surprised.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:30.200
<i>Cute.</i>

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:33.910
You'd better hurry or you'll be
late. What were you doing?

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.240
Yeah.

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:39.080
I just love taking it easy
by the river like this.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.710
Heh? For someone who just started school, you sure are relaxed.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.170
Come on. Let's go.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:44.960
Okay!

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.300
Ah... but you're on a bicycle...

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.560
I don't mind walking. I'd love to chat.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.970
Huh? Isn't that Murakami-san up there?

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.570
You're right, it's the president!

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.040
Hey!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.930
Hey!!!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.180
<i>I pretended not to notice...</i>

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.600
<i>Because I didn't feel like talking.</i>

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.540
Good morning.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.440
Fujikawa-senpai, why aren't you
wearing headphones today?

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.920
I brought them, but I never listen
to music during my commute.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.320
There're all kinds of sounds outside.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:19.950
I like to input all sorts of sounds into my brain so I can use them when I compose.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.700
That's pretty impressive!

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:24.830
So you were the one
listening to music instead.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.310
It's like, backwards!

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:31.300
Yeah... Well, I just get the feeling that people
are laughing at me when I'm in public.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.590
So I tune it out.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:34.300
That doesn't sound healthy...

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.300
Fujikawa-senpai, did you compose something last night?

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.600
Yeah, I have work today, so I
wanted to get it done yesterday.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.190
What's your job?

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.500
I'm a waitress at a family restaurant.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:51.110
You sure are impressive, Fujikawa-senpai!
You compose music and have a job!

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:56.260
Honda-chan, go ahead and call me Kayo. It's not as formal.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.680
T-then... Kayo-senpai.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:02.100
Feels weird...

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.600
So this is how people communicate...

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.580
Hey!

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:08.560
Morning!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.090
Good morning!

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:14.920
Just look! The entire SNS club gathered
before school. We're already in sync!

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.110
The entire club?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.530
Oh! That's right! The four of us is "everyone," huh?

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.260
Y-yeah, sorry...

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:26.600
We're such a weak club that you're
the only freshman who joined.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:30.210
I'm so sorry! I didn't mean it as an insult!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:34.180
Now, now, we might get some new recruits later.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:37.570
But until then, the four of
us need to pull together.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:39.160
Ooh! Positive thinking!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.410
I know! Let's all eat lunch together.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.540
Honda-chan, do you have plans?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.620
N-no. I'm free.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:47.790
Good! That's settled. Well, let's go.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:48.790
Okay.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.840
I'm having lunch in the
clubroom with my senpai.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.080
Ooh! Are you showing your art?

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.820
Wait! This is still a secret!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.060
I wasn't able to draw well last night...

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.050
And, uh...

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.710
Sorry! I've gotta go!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.490
Have fun.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:46.450
Childhood friend dashes away, clutching
something in embarrassment...

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:47.720
<i>Juicy.</i>

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:56.340
I feel so embarrassed showing my art to
people. I only copied other drawings before.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.730
Well... if it doesn't seem possible, just say so.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.720
I really wonder if I'm good enough.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.780
"So we meet again!"

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.910
"Since you live peacefully in the capital,
my vegetable garden flourishes!"

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:15.290
"Behold! The evening dew on this Leontochir! It's just like your-"

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.220
She's crying?!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.990
S-s-s-s-sorry! Sorry I destroyed the mood...

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.810
No! Honda-san, wait up!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.700
It's like... I have to hear the lines out loud,
otherwise I can't write good stories!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.040
"I came up with a great line!"

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.500
It's like, an explosive catharsis!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.590
It's like... It's like...
Anyway, conversation over!

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.090
Show me that sketchbook! Lemme see!

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:47.720
O-okay! You can look at the first half...

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.450
Ooh! So you copied her style.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:56.490
It's kind of surreal seeing fan art for our game.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.280
Um... The next part of the book is, uh...

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:10.160
...based off my own style, rather than imitations.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.300
It's very rough.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.500
Really?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.100
By the way, the cherry blossoms have already fallen.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.300
Going to school is kinda dull now.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.530
<i>Too cute...</i>

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.330
How did you like playing the game we made last year?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.940
The art style was different from the manga I've read, so I was lost at first.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:41.070
But the more I played, the more I
got into it. And I had fun drawing.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.670
Good! Then you'll be fine.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.950
If you drew from the heart,
technique doesn't matter.

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.050
It's that raw artistry I want to see.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:54.380
Then let's trade! I'll show you my
art if you show me your story!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:59.020
But mine is unfinished! I'll gladly
let you read it when it's done!

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.040
O-Oh, really?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:05.260
Then, I'd love to read something from
your past! Do you have any copies?

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:05.980
From my past?!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.300
There's that story I wrote for the Literature Club...

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:11.240
No! Not under any circumstances!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:12.780
That story was...!

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.690
"Stardust Intenzione - Part One"

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.060
By Iris.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:25.360
"It happened the night of my 3037th birthday."

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.700
"The sky was filled with stars so
bright, dripping like tears..."

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:33.160
Shii, stop it! Stop reciting it!
Forget it at once!

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.870
President. When did you get here?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.370
A while ago, we just didn't want to intrude.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.580
Speak up next time!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:39.890
Let's eat lunch.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.670
Honda-chan, about "Stardust Intenzione"...

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:49.720
It is Seki-sensei's magnum opus!
So many plot twists!

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.590
First, the heroine is...

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.430
You wanna eat lead instead of lunch?

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.930
But I'm praising you.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:58.080
My big sister is really
excited to read part two...

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.610
Don't show it! Don't share it!
Don't advertise it!

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:03.020
Aw, come on!

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:03.900
Honda-san...

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.650
Yes?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.050
I put a lot of pressure on you earlier...
Did that bother you?

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.510
Well, uh...

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:12.560
Um...

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:14.970
I'm sorry.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.640
I look forward to seeing your art. We all do.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.350
Thanks!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:28.130
Should we include a Stella x Samyu
romance scene in the next game?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.620
It would look good onscreen,

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.340
but personally...

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:35.640
<i>I think Samyu was the gallant, handsome man in the game...</i>

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.470
<i>I think I remember drawing him.</i>

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.400
<i>I'll show them later!</i>

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:49.380
So you're all ordering the same thing?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.820
Y-Yes! Thank you so much.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.950
I'm impressed, Fujikawa-san.
The look really suits you.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:57.830
Really?

00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:59.660
Welcome!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.750
Table for how many?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.790
Well then! Since this game is a side-story...

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.940
We might not have to actually
design any characters.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.550
We can just use the characters Teru-senpai created.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.010
Is she the person who founded this club?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.620
Yes. She's in college now.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:22.940
Her art style sure is cute. And she's a pretty girl, too.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:28.320
She suddenly brought the three of us together
and suggested we make a game.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:32.490
Yeah, yeah! And she cosplayed as a potato!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.340
A potato?!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.840
Oh, we're okay with you doing new designs.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:39.660
Indeed. You're the entire art department.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.060
So if you have any ideas, let us know.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:46.000
Uh... her drawings were very cute.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.210
And the characters and the story were both wonderful.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.050
You're embarrasing me.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:55.780
It's just that, all the characters were
either pretty or handsome.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:10:00.560
So it felt kind of like a shoujo manga...
Uh... and...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:04.290
I was wondering if we could
put more old men in it!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.180
Th-this is...

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.520
A-anyway! Let's start brainstorming.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.860
After that, we'll outline the story plot.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.640
By the way!
What were you writing during lunch?

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.620
That was just dialogue
for the climactic scene...

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.370
Climactic scene?
That's what you did last time,

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.580
and you completely messed up the time allocation.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.080
So we had to pull all-nighters with Senpai right until Comiket.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.100
W-well, we'll be okay this time!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.420
You started it in middle school...

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.380
and you still haven't written "Stardust Intenzione - Part Two."

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:33.380
What do you mean "this time"...

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.360
Stop going there!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.880
Excuse me...

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.820
You're bothering the other customers, so could you keep your meeting quiet, please?

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.030
S-sorry, Fujikawa-san.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.810
Back on track! Once I get the plot set up,
I'll start to give you orders, Honda-san.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:51.190
Give those orders sooner this time.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:51.920
I'll try!

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.940
Does that mean I'm not drawing anything yet?

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:59.430
Right. You have to wait until Aya tells
you what she needs for the story.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:03.280
Anyway, I guess we're done for
now. Any questions, Honda-san?

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:06.910
Honda-san?

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:11.690
Eh? Uh! Well, you both just
seem like such close friends...

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:16.590
I was just realizing that friendship is
important when doing a group project.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:17.570
Friendship?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.400
Shiina is an old childhood friend, that's all.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.300
Stop calling me by name.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.270
Aw, come on! It's a cute name!
Don't you agree?

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:29.440
Well, Aya? You'd be cuter if you dressed
in black like you used to.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:32.400
Also, if you talked like a boy—

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.990
Stop bringing up the the past! Why do
you always have to do this to me...

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.590
Excuse me...

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.670
Guess we got kicked out!

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.970
I hope we didn't make Fujikawa-senpai mad.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:50.230
Nah, she just takes everything too seriously.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.960
Well, I'm this way.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.130
Sure. See ya.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.190
Goodbye.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.180
Shii has cram school right now.

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:00.740
She sure is studious.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:06.520
And she's right, it was my fault that we were short on time with the last game.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:12.060
So this time I want to pump out the story fast!
I did some brainstorming, so behold my...

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:15.130
Oh, sorry! I promise I'll add some old men!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.440
Uh, that's not it. Um... I'm sorry.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.660
You all are so close.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:25.450
And I wonder if it's appropriate for me to work on your next project.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:31.000
If you ask me, I don't want to be clannish.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:36.980
Our first game stands on its own. This one should have your style in it...

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.340
Anyway, what I mean...

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.640
I wasn't lying when I said I wanted to see your art.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:42.760
So let's do our best!

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:43.600
O-okay!

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:47.710
Oh, but I think adding old men is a great idea!

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.980
Uh, yeah... I'll try.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:01.710
<i>They say I still don't have to draw
anything... but will I really be okay?</i>

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:05.990
<i>No, I decided I'd stop being so indecisive! I need to do my best.</i>

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:06.980
Huh?

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:10.650
This is her notebook...

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.110
Did I the notebook at the restaurant yesterday?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.600
I don't think you forgot anything...

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.070
You still can't find it?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.640
The safety of that book of darkness is second only to my life!

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:34.900
It's because you don't organize things.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.200
Um...

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:40.530
This... fell into my bag.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.530
It was so... um... <i>adult</i>...

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:48.220
I had no idea you wrote stuff like that.

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:53.750
Those are manuscripts from my past self! That's not me!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.160
I didn't write that!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.420
What's she babbling about...

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.730
Yumine, I'm so sorry I pushed this on you.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:05.280
It's okay. I've always wanted
to see the club you joined.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.450
So I just show your sketches
to your clubmates, right?

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:14.580
Yeah... I'm too embarrassed, but how can I make a game if I don't show them...

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.690
You should just show them yourself!

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.690
B-b-but I'm scared!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:22.530
The drawings their founder made were so cool!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:26.340
But when I draw, it ends up looking like the art in the manga I have...

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.080
What if they're angry and think I'm no good as her successor...

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:34.580
<i>Ah... She's right...
Her house is full of retro manga...</i>

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.870
<i>Hard-boiled manga, at that.</i>

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.560
By the way, it's okay for me to look, right?

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.880
It's been a while since I've seen your art...

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:42.560
N-not yet!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.780
But you'll see it in the club room anyway...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.970
Look at it in gently later, okay?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.490
Who looks at art <i>gently</i>?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:55.390
Fine! I'll think about Papa
and calm myself down!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:58.100
Today is the fourth Saturday!
He's coming home!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.550
Look at all those expressions.
It's truly wonderful...

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:10.010
Some Dead Fish Eyes, Not Enough Sunlight, Shuttle Run Club

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.830
That's an amazing name...

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:17.410
Tama-chan, what're ya doing?
Grandma is lookin' for ya!

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.390
Ahm playing house!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:23.130
<i>She was so absent-minded up until now,</i>

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:26.990
<i>but she found a club to devote herself to, and she's become very expressive.</i>

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:30.650
<i>I'm so happy you found
a wholesome club, Tama-chan...</i>

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.330
Excuse me...

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:38.160
Huh?

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.660
My apologies. We were dancing.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.320
Please forgive us, we were not aware that we were receiving company.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.720
Want some snacks?

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:46.740
Th-thanks.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.740
Moving one's body helps stimulate the brain.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:55.140
Trust us, we really do make games here.
We have a finished game to prove it...

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.720
Uh, sure.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.130
P-Please don't speak ill of us...

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:03.750
No, I wasn't planning on it.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.300
You came to see us during
the Club PR event, right?

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.220
Are you here for Honda-san?

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.220
Yes. She sent me here.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.660
She wanted me to show you this.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.890
Ooh! So we can see it?

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:19.300
Yes, and so can I. I'm dying
to see what she drew...

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:23.250
Th-that's just the sound she makes
when she's composing!

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.000
Hey! Be professional!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:32.720
This is Tama-chan's first club. She's really excited and trying her best.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.720
Yeah! She's been very assertive so far.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:40.620
Tama-chan is trying to change.
And I want to be supportive.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.350
But something might be worrying me...

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:48.120
No, I am worried! Is that absent-minded girl actually fitting in here?

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.090
What's with the noises?!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.640
Compose with your headphones on!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.070
This doesn't sound right...

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.120
She's just a beginner, but she's
great at copying drawings.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.870
She didn't show me any of
her own designs, though.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.330
Yes. It was the same with me...

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:11.490
I want you to show these to the club while I'm
not there. I'm embarrassed to show my art.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:16.450
But I have to reveal everything to them or we
can't make games together! Everything...

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:22.250
Did you make sweet, innocent Tama-chan draw
lewd drawings? What kind of club is this!

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.140
Aren't you misunderstanding something?!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:27.400
So wait, if she's drawing art for a game...

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.840
...does that mean she'll have to do it digitally?

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.380
Yeah, eventually.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.480
Is there anyone who can teach her how?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.490
Um...

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:44.100
We should ask Teru-senpai. She'd
probably teach her a little...

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.440
No, we can't! We decided we'd let
her leave for good, remember?

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:49.650
True, but...

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.580
Hey, Fujikawa-san, do you have any leads?

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:58.910
Are you listening? Like maybe Temawari-san?

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.260
Temawari-san?

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.580
Te— You mean <i>the</i> Temawari-san?!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:06.400
The artist famous for "Devilishly
Cute Shogi Art Book 800?!"

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.600
Uh... Is that her book?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:12.570
I'm a huge fan of Temawari-san!
She's famous on the internet, too!

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:16.640
Right, so I hear. Apparently
they're sort of friends.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.300
Would you please introduce me?

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.760
You surprised me!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.060
You should have told me we had company.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.600
Man, you're slow!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.610
Whoa, so you're Honda-chan's friend.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:31.440
I'm Fujikawa Kayo, the composer.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.440
I'm a first year, Fuda Yumine.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:38.120
Hey, even if you're composing, you should
pay attention to your surroundings.

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:39.370
Sorry!

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:44.120
But Temawari-san wants to make a BL drama
CD, so I was composing music for that...

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.620
I was having a hard time.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.650
Temawari-sensei's boys' love...

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.630
What?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.400
The artwork is super pretty!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:57.840
I can probably help her with digital
art, if you guys are okay with that.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:58.920
Oh? Really?

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:01.870
Anyway, let's discuss this
after we see Tama-chan's art.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.590
Here.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.080
<i>Ahh... Hard-boiled, as expected...</i>

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.560
<i>And not "just a little," either...</i>

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:22.360
How mean! You don't have to laugh! How
would Tama-chan feel if she were here?!

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:26.140
Sorry! But I don't think she
needs to feel embarrassed.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:29.460
It's true, her style is very different from Teru-senpai's.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.100
That's probably what's tripping her up.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.110
But it's really good! And also fun.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.800
Fun?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:42.530
I could picture her smiling, the way she did
when she doodled for us at Club PR.

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:47.660
If she smiles like that when she draws,
our characters are sure to be happy.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.020
But man... they're so manly!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.870
You won't fool me! Don't try to cover it with flattery!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:56.830
Sorry. She's just like that. It's natural.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.340
Excuse me...

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.740
Oh! Welcome, Yumine!
Did you show them my sketchbook?

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:04.620
How'd it go?

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:05.760
Well...

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.210
<i>I feel kinda trapped...</i>

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:14.420
I mean, "it's all okay as long as she's
smiling" doesn't say anything about the art itself.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.280
Th-they said, "Keep practicing."

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:22.090
I knew it.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.840
Sorry. I was just kidding.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:33.130
They said that as long as you're happy
when you draw, that's all that matters.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.960
They said that will make the characters happy.

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:38.860
Draw with a smile?

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:40.820
See ya later.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.160
Oh, thanks!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:50.160
But listen... I think you should
show them your art yourself.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:53.140
You drew it, Tama-chan. It's your art!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.020
Okay?

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.450
Now I see. So that's the image we're going for.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.910
It'll really expand the world, so I like it!

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:11.870
Me too! If we don't change it at least this much, what's the point of doing new art?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.210
I got it. I'll do my best to incorporate
these into the story.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.700
Really?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:22.460
And I can help you with
digital art if you want.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:23.460
Sure!

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:27.620
But, Yumine, aren't you
busy with the Illustration Club?

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:33.870
Well... Will you help me with my drawing
projects when I need it?

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.040
Of course! I'll do my best.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:41.010
No! I'm not gonna force sweet, innocent Tama-chan to draw BL...

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:46.110
and blush like this and say "It's cute~." I'm not thinking of indecent things like that!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:47.610
Yumine?

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:24.220
Who is it.

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:26.070
Stella, let's run away together.

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:27.110
And who are you?

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.380
Stop!

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.060
<i>First let's focus on completing just one.</i>

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:31.950
But I...
